---
// Features.astro - Grid de cards interativos destacando os pilares do SGEMH da SaaSCore Sistemas
---

<section id="recursos" class="relative py-24 sm:py-32">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
      <span class="inline-block rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-cyan-400 border border-cyan-500/20">
        Módulos do Sistema SGEMH • SaaSCore
      </span>
      <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl">
        Gestão Eletrônica de Ativos & Engenharia Clínica Integrada
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate-300">
        Uma suíte completa para inventário, ciclo de ordens de serviço, calibrações rastreadas e controle financeiro de tecnologias em saúde.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Grid com Cards Interativos -->
    <div class="mt-16 grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">
      
      <!-- Card 1: Gestão Eletrônica de Ativos & Inventário -->
      <div class="group relative flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/40 p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-cyan-500/50 hover:bg-slate-900/80 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-cyan-500/10">
        <div class="absolute -top-12 -right-12 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 blur-2xl transition group-hover:bg-cyan-500/20"></div>
        <div>
          <div class="flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400 border border-cyan-500/20 group-hover:bg-cyan-500 group-hover:text-slate-950 transition-colors">
            <!-- Ícone Gestão de Ativos / Prédio / Chip -->
            <svg class="h-7 w-7" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">
            Gestão Eletrônica de Ativos
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Inventário técnico automatizado com identificação inteligente por QR Code. Controle detalhado do ciclo de vida, localização por setor hospitalar, criticidade assistencial e cálculo de depreciação.
          </p>

          <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2.5 text-xs text-slate-400">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-cyan-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Etiquetagem com QR Code e prontuário digital do equipamento</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-cyan-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Classificação de risco clínico e criticidade (Grau I a IV)</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-cyan-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Localização física e transferências entre setores</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-slate-800/80">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-cyan-400 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">
            Saiba mais sobre Gestão de Ativos &rarr;
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Ciclo de Ordens de Serviço & Engenharia Clínica -->
      <div class="group relative flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/40 p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-cyan-500/50 hover:bg-slate-900/80 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-cyan-500/10">
        <div class="absolute -top-12 -right-12 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-blue-600/10 blur-2xl transition group-hover:bg-blue-600/20"></div>
        <div>
          <div class="flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-400 border border-blue-500/20 group-hover:bg-blue-600 group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
            <!-- Ícone Ciclo OS -->
            <svg class="h-7 w-7" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-6 9l2 2 4-4" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">
            Ciclo de Ordens de Serviço (OS)
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Fluxo automatizado de manutenções preventivas, corretivas e preditivas. Abertura ágil de chamados pela equipe assistencial via celular e controle estrito de SLA para UTIs e Centros Cirúrgicos.
          </p>

          <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2.5 text-xs text-slate-400">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-cyan-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Abertura instantânea de chamados via escaneamento mobile</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-cyan-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Monitoramento em tempo real de MTBF, MTTR e SLA</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-cyan-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Histórico completo de peças aplicadas e laudos técnicos</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-slate-800/80">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-cyan-400 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">
            Ver fluxo de Ordens de Serviço &rarr;
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Metrologia & Calibração com Rastreabilidade -->
      <div class="group relative flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/40 p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-cyan-500/50 hover:bg-slate-900/80 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-cyan-500/10">
        <div class="absolute -top-12 -right-12 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 blur-2xl transition group-hover:bg-cyan-500/20"></div>
        <div>
          <div class="flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400 border border-cyan-500/20 group-hover:bg-cyan-500 group-hover:text-slate-950 transition-colors">
            <!-- Ícone Calibração / Metrologia -->
            <svg class="h-7 w-7" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">
            Metrologia & Calibração Rastreada
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Cronograma metrológico automatizado com emissão de certificados digitais validados (ICP-Brasil), cálculo de incerteza de medição e controle de padrões calibrados na RBC/Inmetro.
          </p>

          <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2.5 text-xs text-slate-400">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-cyan-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Padrões rastreados RBC/Inmetro e ensaios IEC 60601</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-cyan-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Certificados com assinatura digital e autenticação QR Code</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-cyan-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              <span>Dossiês prontos para auditorias ANVISA, ONA e JCI</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-slate-800/80">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-cyan-400 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">
            Conhecer módulo de Metrologia &rarr;
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
